Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Ep 5
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Title,0000,0000,0000,,A little Hide-and-Seek
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:12.90,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato-chan! Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:13.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:15.85,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Read this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:19.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:22.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The Firefly’s Light…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.52,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:26.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:29.27,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you read, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:33.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can read!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:09.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When nighttime came, the\Nriverbank became pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:13.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight, it seems like the moon is taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:21.56,KM,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,Eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:24.41,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, you skipped something again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:25.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:28.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.61,0:02:32.38,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’re as slow as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:37.67,KM,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep trying, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:39.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.64,0:02:43.28,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’re still messing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:54.98,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. This is Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:59.40,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you that that’s unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:04.53,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The preschool is open right now, so if you’ll please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:12.68,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, you fell down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:14.23,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:23.64,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato! What are you doing at a serious time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:26.54,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:28.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:31.10,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:32.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Marina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.27,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,It would be nice if you could get\Nbetter at reading picture books, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:38.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:42.39,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay. You’ll get better someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:43.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:00.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:05.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want the kids to enjoy my storytelling, so I’d like to practice reading more. {Keeper: orig line "So everyone can enjoy it, I want to practice reading."}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:06.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it all right if I borrow this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:10.31,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure. I don’t mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:13.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to try my best so I can read better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:15.69,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:25.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly lived all alone for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:31.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So long that he forgot there\Nwere other fireflies out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.79,KM,Kobato (not reading),0000,0000,0000,,Being all alone is lonely, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:37.54,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:45.02,KM,Kobato (reading),0000,0000,0000,,On this completely dark day, he felt like\Nsomething wonderful was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:45.70,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:51.70,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:53.89,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Could you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:54.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:58.06,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I said, stop reading that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:05.33,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That guy sure puts out some bad vibes. {Keeper: orig line "He’s giving me a bad feeling.". Ioryogi sounds different so I thought I’d change his accent lol. Feel free to put it back if you don’t like it}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.56,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:10.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:12.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The old man from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:17.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:18.46,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What’s this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:21.46,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn’t he look completely different than before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.31,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if something’s bothering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:33.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you not have a house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:35.73,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How’d you come up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:39.80,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is that, until just a little while ago I was living in the park,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:45.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,but thanks to Sayaka-sensei and Chitose-san,\NI have a soft and fluffy futon to sleep on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Futons really are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.80,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:52.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you like, would you care to come to my home? {Keeper: orig line "If you would like to, would you come to my house?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:55.50,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t need assistance from someone I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:59.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Hanato Kobato and this is Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:08.47,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t associate with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:16.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why he’s so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:24.84,KM,Kobato (reading),0000,0000,0000,,The firefly saw a small but beautiful light off in the distance. {Keeper: orig line "The firefly found a beautiful, distant but small light."}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.78,KM,Kobato (reading),0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how I can get closer to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I really am slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow, I’m going to continue to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I overslept again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:55.60,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just how flaky can you be? {Keeper: orig line "How dull are you going to get?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:58.79,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you show up late again,\NFujimoto won’t be nice about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:03.77,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:15.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:18.86,KM,Gangster 1,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:20.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have some kind of business here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:27.92,KM,Gangster 2,0000,0000,0000,,We came to collect the debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.92,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What? Debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:33.30,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,These guys seem dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:35.51,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:37.89,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,Kids really love these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:40.31,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:42.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.98,KM,Gangster 1,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:54.87,KM,Gangster 1,0000,0000,0000,,You bumped into me and\Ndidn’t even say you were sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:07.17,KM,Gangster 1,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.17,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your hands off the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:11.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:12.72,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,You little…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:17.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:20.02,KM,Gangster 2,0000,0000,0000,,Mess with us, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.31,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:25.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:31.31,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve asked you before to please not come while the preschool is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:33.84,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,You’re giving us orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:38.20,KM,Gangster 2,0000,0000,0000,,But aren’t you the one who’s\Nnot returning our money, Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:41.35,KM,Gangster 2,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn’t be taking this lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:43.58,KM,Gangster 2,0000,0000,0000,,Just because our boss is nice to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:47.54,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,We can have this conversation after the preschool closes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:48.04,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,So please{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:52.42,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,If you give us what we’re asking for, we’ll be gone in a jiffy. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:55.05,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,Give us what we want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.05,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You{\fscx200}-{\r}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:07.77,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,P-Please go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.91,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:22.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:26.58,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,We don’t have the time to play with brats like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:31.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:35.30,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,What’s up with this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:37.13,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Police Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:40.32,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Please help us! There are scary people here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:42.38,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:45.52,KM,Gangster 3,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll leave for now, but we’ll keep coming back unless you give us the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.31,KM,Gangster 1,0000,0000,0000,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:01.91,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:04.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:11.34,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,They’re fake tears, so I’m okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:15.56,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I thought they'd leave if I called for a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:19.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right? Well, they really did leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:20.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:23.46,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun, you’re awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.31,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.02,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,If they come again, I’ll run them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.40,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato, you did good today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:37.87,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But how long can I continue like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:58.73,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The phone call yesterday must have been from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:02.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:05.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if there's anything I can do to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:07.27,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you have no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:14.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But if I can help her pay the debt, I could heal Sayaka-sensei’s heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:22.40,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:33.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,200)}Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:40.51,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:44.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He’s still there. What’s he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be…!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:52.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:57.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:01.11,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine. Nothing’s wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:01.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:05.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t there anything I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If something’s bothering you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:12.76,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing’s bothering me. I have a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.92,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I just like being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:16.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:20.92,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,The picture book from yesterday…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I borrowed it from the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:28.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve been practicing, but somehow I’m not getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.85,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you not to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:32.69,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:35.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone really likes this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:37.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I want to read this well…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:39.73,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Please, I’m asking you not to read it! {Keeper: orig line "I’m asking you. Just don’t read it."}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:40.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.00,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,It’s nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:49.89,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Does he really hate this book that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:09.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here, Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.52,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re my neighbor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.35,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, isn’t it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.87,0:13:19.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:20.36,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:25.43,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A man I met in the park told me not to read this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:28.05,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Did you meet Mori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:29.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:33.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something wrong with Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:36.12,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, he’s the book’s author.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:41.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:43.62,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,He’s famous in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:48.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But why did he tell me not to read the book, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.15,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:50.76,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:55.52,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,They say that it’s the very last book he wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:00.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The last book?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:10.45,KM,Kobato (reading),0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1300)}A firefly lived alongside a beautiful stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:16.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(963,0}This firefly lived all alone for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:20.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So long that he eventually forgot there were other fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:24.65,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,One dark night, when there was no moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:29.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,the firefly saw a small but\Nbeautiful light off in the distance. {Keeper: orig line "The firefly found a distant, small but beautiful light. "}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:32.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“What is it?” he thought as he approached it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:35.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was a female insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:41.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“So beautiful! What kind of insect are you?” he asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:45.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“I’m the same as you, a firefly,” answered the female firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:50.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The female firefly continued,\N“Why is it that you don’t sparkle?”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:57.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly that was always alone had forgotten how to sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:04.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(998,0)}So, the female firefly explained to the lonely firefly how to sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.77,0:15:10.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And with that, the two fireflies stayed together on the bank of the stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:12.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and grew much closer, while sparkling together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:20.14,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe that old man has forgotten how to sparkle as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:24.40,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know why, but he does\Nseem like the firefly in that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:28.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if there is something I can do for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:39.47,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hey! What are you starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:40.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:41.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:46.96,KM,Ioryogi (the final one),0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:53.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you free this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:04.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go watch the fireflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:07.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be waiting by the stream at Hachimanyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:19.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I am a firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:25.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can shine like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:27.53,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’re getting better at this, aren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.53,0:16:30.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure he can remember how to sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:33.99,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But it seems like he’s not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:41.32,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, there was no way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:45.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, the fireflies haven’t come out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.43,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Why’d you say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.60,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,“Let’s go see the fireflies.”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:53.95,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,“I’ll be waiting by the stream at Hachimanyama.”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:57.10,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,You sound just like Naoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:59.65,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:03.10,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,She was… my beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:04.87,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,The pictures…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:08.12,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko drew those pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:12.60,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,She said a firefly story would be\Ngood, so I went ahead and wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:14.80,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,After that, she drew the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:18.16,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,300)}Let’s go see the fireflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:22.80,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, I said let’s go see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:25.51,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,You promised, didn’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:25.51,KOP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:27.73,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:29.11,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:30.27,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,I found a place no one knows about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.21,0:17:33.00,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I said I don’t have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:35.03,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be waiting by the stream at Hachimanyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:45.85,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,700)}Hello? Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:45.85,KO,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,700)}In the end, I didn’t go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:48.91,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, I was very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:51.05,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I had a lot of deadlines approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:53.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then your beloved went all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:57.22,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,It was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:00.43,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,She said she wanted to show it to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:08.72,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,There was something sad about the pictures she drew, but they were beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:12.83,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,So I wrote a new story that was sad, yet beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:17.32,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,A while after the book was finished…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:19.78,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Finally, you have a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.49,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I’m waiting in the same park as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:39.97,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko! Hey, Naoko! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.34,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Soutarou-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:44.97,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:46.57,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.57,0:18:48.17,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll bring you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:51.10,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:56.73,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Fireflies… I wanted to see them with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:07.12,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn’t I go with her back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.24,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,All she wanted was to see them with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:14.00,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn’t I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:21.74,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I’m leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:28.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you wait just a little longer, surely…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:39.69,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.69,0:19:41.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:53.00,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,This place…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:05.64,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko stood here, drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:10.73,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:33.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:48.18,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You haven’t seen fireflies before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.64,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,What? Sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:52.77,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Then, let’s go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.77,0:20:54.69,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t see the real thing, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:57.90,KP,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,But there aren’t any fireflies in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:21:00.42,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll definitely show them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:01.59,KP,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:15.49,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,A promise, huh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:27.48,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty, aren’t they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:28.51,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,The fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:44.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They really are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:47.13,KM,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:56.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The old man remembered how to sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:21:59.83,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He’s writing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.06,0:22:07.84,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,As proof…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:09.84,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,…look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:12.68,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There’s one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:14.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Which means…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:17.44,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You healed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:22.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was able to help Mori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:28.03,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This time it’s a perfect 100 points… or so I’d like to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:31.49,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But at the library, you treated me poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:36.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, 80 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:39.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.38,0:22:41.82,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,From now on, we have to go at a much faster pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:44.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:50.94,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But I must be getting soft, giving you 80 points after that. Maybe 50 would be better…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.94,0:22:53.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No! 80 points is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:55.27,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I guess it’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:55.27,KO,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:56.25,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,79 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.77,0:22:59.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1500)}That’s so unfair!
